'''Lisia''' (Japanese: '''ルチア''' ''Litia'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Put 2 random Basic Pokémon with 50&nbsp;HP or less from your deck into your hand.
}}

